  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Concept note Solar cold chain Lake Turkana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide input for the multi-annual country strategy (MLS) for the embassy in Kenya, which is currently being prepared and shall be realised by the Netherlands Embassy in Nairobi by October 2022. The concept note should improve the embassy&apos;s understanding of the possibilities of economic development of the fisheries sector in terms of the solar cold chain around Lake Turkana. The results can lead to interventions where Dutch added value, aid and trade, and investment perspectives all converge, benefiting local parties.</narrative>
  </description>
